  "ingredients": [
    "1 tablespoon olive oil",
    "3 slices bacon",
    "1 large onion, chopped",
    "2 cloves garlic, minced",
    "1 pound fresh collard greens, cut into 2-inch pieces",
    "3 cups chicken broth",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 teaspoon pepper",
    "1 pinch red pepper flakes"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/cr114AtWMjPVKR2DvaW6_tg--5A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/51803-Kickin-Collard-Greens-DDMFS-Step1-11963-861e806494f742e6bc42ce131a7d09a9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51803/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat oil in a large pot over medium-high heat. Add bacon, and cook until crisp, 5 to 7 minutes. Remove bacon from pan with a slotted spoon, crumble, and return to the pan.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/W0DrnOuT--MKC-jBdgF3xbUBbIY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/51803-KickingCollardGreens-mfs-step2-00943-e33a7ca673354387a6ffe9b0a5f67651.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51803/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add onion to the pan and cook until tender, about 5 minutes. Add garlic, and cook until just fragrant. Add collard greens, and fry until they start to wilt.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/pQ3Vk3WDnoh07STtwRwP_xM7t5o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/51803-KickingCollardGreens-mfs-step3-00944-8825114612dd401c93c565f25f3d3a46.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51803/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in chicken broth and season with salt, pepper, and red pepper flakes. Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer until greens are tender, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Z1FJrMK38j0WbERUyN4s2M7mbO8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/51803-KickingCollardGreens-mfs-step4-00945-01bb633c38864480a13f79887d9278b8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51803/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Taste and add extra pepper flakes for more heat, if desired. Serve hot and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/kKeG9eYyM-jUuVrrVR1QhVUtlfw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/51803-kickin-collard-greens-DDMFS-4x3-3905e4f067084b14a4bb14007fb80046.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/51803/step_05.webp"
    }
  ],
